%% vLLM Request Data Flow
%% Commit: 67745d189fd981ee824bde35666a3737a962c031

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as API Server
    participant Proc as Processor
    participant Core as EngineCore
    participant Sched as Scheduler
    participant KV as KVCacheManager
    participant Worker as GPU Worker
    participant Model as Model Runner

    User->>API: HTTP Request
    API->>Proc: Process Input
    Proc->>Proc: Tokenize + Validate
    Proc->>Core: Add Request

    loop Each Iteration
        Core->>Sched: Schedule Step
        Sched->>KV: Allocate Blocks
        KV-->>Sched: Block Tables
        Sched-->>Core: Scheduled Batch

        Core->>Worker: Execute Model
        Worker->>Model: Forward Pass
        Model->>Model: Attention + FFN
        Model-->>Worker: Logits
        Worker->>Worker: Sample Tokens
        Worker-->>Core: New Tokens

        Core->>Proc: Process Output

        alt Streaming
            Proc-->>API: Partial Response
            API-->>User: SSE Event
        end

        alt Request Complete
            Sched->>KV: Free Blocks
        end
    end

    Proc-->>API: Final Response
    API-->>User: Complete Response
